      "name": "Dany Robert",
      "created_at": "2026-01-10T12:21:10.152Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This scenario also fails:</p>\n<p>Sales Order → Pick List → Delivery Note → Sales Invoice<br>\nThen, create Delivery Return and then Sales Return</p>\n<p>Now Sales Order is open because items got returned. But you can no longer generate pick list to deliver again.</p>",
