      "username": "mihir-kandoi",
      "name": "Mihir Kandoi",
      "created_at": "2026-01-10T12:36:57.470Z",
      "cooked": "<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/rtdany10\">@rtdany10</a> once a DN is made against an SO the SO completes. Generally speaking, if items are returned and replacements are to be sent, a new SO is created. This is because an invoice is generated and when the items are returned and a debit note is received against that SO.</p>",
